WEBVTT

NOTE
Train coupling sequence — the SeeD and presidential trains lock together, then the mission train arrives at a station.
Duration: approximately 30 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Both trains run side by side; the coupling arm extends between them across the gap.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The coupling mechanism connects the two trains. They now move as one unit.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The party falls asleep on the train — a dream begins: an orange locomotive by a large moon.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The dream dissolves. The trains continue through the countryside toward Timber.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The train pulls into Timber Station. Platform structures come into view.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The green train car passes close to the platform as the train slows to a stop.
